{
  "title": { "zh": "举个例子" },
  "tray": "proof",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "<part-ref to=\"part:exI\"></part-ref>使用<level-ref to=\"decl-ex\"></level-ref>写下的引入规则：有对象满足某个条件，就可以说存在满足这个条件的对象。接入关于该对象的命题；若能得出多个存在命题，在元件上选择所需的结论。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "q-exI",
      "kind": "proof",
      "consts": ["i"],
      "tests": [{ "premises": { "p": "P(i) ∧ Q(i)" }, "goal": "∃x. Q(x)" }],
      "cases": [{ "P": "Human", "Q": "Mortal" }, { "P": "Student", "Q": "School" }],
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "拆出「安会死」，接进<part-ref to=\"part:exI\"></part-ref>。"
        }
      ],
      "solution": ["s = andE(p)", "i = exI(s.right)", "goal <- i"]
    }
  ]
}
